1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:01,518
Before inventing a
spell,

2
00:00:01,538 --> 00:00:03,532
answer these three
questions.

3
00:00:03,552 --> 00:00:04,795
One:
what can it do?

4
00:00:04,815 --> 00:00:06,817
Menders fix anything
broken.

5
00:00:06,837 --> 00:00:08,117
Two:
what stops it?

6
00:00:08,137 --> 00:00:09,467
Only what they
touched before it

7
00:00:09,487 --> 00:00:10,354
broke.

8
00:00:10,374 --> 00:00:11,786
Three:
what does it cost?

9
00:00:11,806 --> 00:00:14,062
Each mend cracks
something they own.

10
00:00:14,082 --> 00:00:15,875
Then the queen's
crown shatters.

11
00:00:15,895 --> 00:00:17,681
The only mender who
ever held it?

12
00:00:17,701 --> 00:00:18,793
A thief.

13
00:00:18,813 --> 00:00:20,536
Three answers,
and the story writes

14
00:00:20,556 --> 00:00:21,660
itself.

15
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:21,973
Can.

16
00:00:21,993 --> 00:00:22,423
Can't.

17
00:00:22,443 --> 00:00:23,185
Costs.

18
00:00:23,205 --> 00:00:24,610
Answer all three
before your first

19
00:00:24,630 --> 00:00:25,680
spell.

20
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,505
Save this before
designing your next

21
00:00:27,525 --> 00:00:28,955
magic system.
